If dev->ishtp_dma_tx_map is NULL (i.e., not allocated or initialization failed or pointer is reset elsewhere), then both dev->ishtp_dma_tx_map[i+j] and dev->ishtp_dma_tx_map[i+j] = 1 result in undefined behavior – specifically, a **null pointer dereference**.

