**Code Snippet Analysis**
Here’s the critical part:
```c
if (base_type(reg->type) == PTR_TO_MAP_VALUE) {
    const struct bpf_map *map = reg->map_ptr;

    if (map->inner_map_meta) {
        reg->type = CONST_PTR_TO_MAP;
